WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.200
All right.

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:00.734
And now

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:03.937
to a CNN exclusive, chilling new details

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:06.072
about the attack on the husband of House

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:07.574
Speaker Nancy Pelosi.

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:08.975
A source familiar with the incident

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:11.478
tells CNN that the suspected assailant

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:15.515
had a bag of zip ties during the break in

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:16.383
on Friday.

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:18.284
Paul Pelosi is still recovering

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:19.686
in a hospital this morning.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:21.321
He suffered a skull fracture

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:23.790
and injuries to his hands and right arm

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:25.959
when he was struck with a hammer.

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:26.793
President Biden

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:28.094
speaking about the attack

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:29.729
for the first time and blasting

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:31.731
those who have propped up

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:34.501
conspiracy theories

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:38.204
It's one thing to condemn the violence,

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.206
but you can't condemn the violence

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.042
unless you condemn those people.

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:43.743
Continue to argue

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:45.912
the election was not real

00:00:45.912 --> 00:00:47.914
that is being stolen.

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:48.982
That all the

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:50.617
all the Milwaukee that's been

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:52.919
put out there to undermine democracy

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:55.789
CNN Sunlen Serfaty

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:57.424
has more from Washington.

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:57.991
Sunlen, we're

00:00:57.991 --> 00:00:59.092
also hearing from the House

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:01.261
speaker for the first time

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:02.262
since this attack.

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:03.496
What does she have to say?

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:04.130
That's right, Fred.

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.866
And you can really hear the raw emotion

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:07.634
in her voice

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:08.968
when she put out this statement

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:09.602
using words

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:12.205
like heartbreaking and traumatizing

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:13.907
to describe this attack.

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:15.475
That happened on her husband.

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:17.544
And she says in court in part, quote,

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:18.778
Friday morning,

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:21.681
a violent man broke into our family home,

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:23.783
demanded to confront me

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:26.286
and brutally attacked my husband, Paul.

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:27.387
Our children,

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:29.222
our grandchildren and I

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:30.223
are heartbroken

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:31.925
and traumatized by the life

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:33.827
threatening attack on our pop.

00:01:33.827 --> 00:01:35.095
We are grateful for the quick

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:36.729
response of law enforcement

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.231
and emergency services

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:40.600
and for the lifesaving medical care

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:42.102
he is receiving.

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:43.670
And one part of good news

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:44.370
in this statement,

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.606
she does mention that her husband

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:49.709
is continuing to have a better condition,

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:50.243
he says.

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:51.644
She says every day

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:53.847
his condition gets better.

00:01:53.847 --> 00:01:55.582
This was her first statement

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:57.117
coming from her own voice

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.651
since the attack on Friday.

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:00.386
And this was a dear colleague

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:01.688
that was sent to members

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:03.456
and staff on Capitol Hill.

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:04.858
And it comes also at a time

00:02:04.858 --> 00:02:05.558
that there is

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:08.027
heightened anxiety about members

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:09.496
and their family members,

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:10.864
personal safety

00:02:10.864 --> 00:02:13.466
and a lot of lawmakers are frustrated.

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:16.202
They also received a letter yesterday

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:17.971
from the House sergeant of arms

00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:19.205
and the chief of the US

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:21.141
Capitol Police updating them

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:23.710
about what existing protocol is in place

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:24.711
to protect them,

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:27.347
what services are already offered.

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:28.047
But again,

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:29.048
a lot of members,

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.650
especially in light of this latest

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:32.352
brutal attack,

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:33.586
say that's not good enough

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:34.621
and are frustrated

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:35.788
and want more security.

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:37.323
So that's something that certainly

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:39.893
this week, Fred, will be on top of mind.

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:42.495
And many lawmakers mind as they

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:44.297
grapple with the

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:46.533
fallout from this brutal attack.

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:48.801
Sunlen Serfaty in Washington,

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.837
thank you so much.

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:52.272
Meantime, House Minority Leader

00:02:52.272 --> 00:02:53.373
Kevin McCarthy

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:55.141
is weighing in on the attack

00:02:55.141 --> 00:02:56.843
and he did so again in the last

00:02:56.843 --> 00:03:00.346
hour saying this on Fox News.

00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:01.981
Let me be perfectly clear violence

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:02.882
or threat of violence

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:04.350
has no place in our society.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:05.518
And what happened to Paul

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:07.787
Pelosi is wrong.

00:03:07.787 --> 00:03:08.454
Having heard it,

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:10.757
I reached out and called the speaker

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:13.359
she was on a plane back for her husband,

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:14.761
but so we were able to communicate

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:15.628
by text.

00:03:15.628 --> 00:03:17.564
She did say that the surgery went well.

00:03:17.564 --> 00:03:18.431
I wanted to convey

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:19.566
that our thoughts and prayers

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:20.733
were with her and her family

00:03:20.733 --> 00:03:21.734
and with Paul.

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:24.270
And we hope for him a speedy recovery

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.172
and that we're able to stop this crime

00:03:26.172 --> 00:03:27.540
across our country.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.608
Of course, this gets

00:03:28.608 --> 00:03:30.410
really deranged and others

00:03:31.978 --> 00:03:33.146
joining us right now,

00:03:33.146 --> 00:03:34.714
Illinois Democrat Congressman

00:03:34.714 --> 00:03:36.749
Raja Krishnamoorthi, a congressman.

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:38.651
So good to see you.

00:03:38.651 --> 00:03:39.452
So, you know,

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:40.520
I wonder you know,

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:41.588
while the minority leader

00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:44.657
is condemning violence, he didn't

00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:47.827
address the spread of conspiracy theories

00:03:47.827 --> 00:03:50.129
that may have led up to an attack

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:52.498
like what was experienced on Paul Pelosi.

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:53.733
I mean, he said

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:55.868
violence has no place in our society.

00:03:56.135 --> 00:03:58.304
What happened to Paul Pelosi is wrong.

00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:01.074
I mean, without being disrespectful,

00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:01.541
I mean, that's

00:04:01.541 --> 00:04:03.243
just overstating the obvious.

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:05.678
But does it more need to be said

00:04:06.045 --> 00:04:07.981
from leadership of all parties?

00:04:07.981 --> 00:04:09.916
I mean, what is the risk of,

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:10.883
say, the minority leader?

00:04:10.883 --> 00:04:12.986
Not saying more than that.

00:04:14.854 --> 00:04:16.289
You're correct, Fredricka.

00:04:16.289 --> 00:04:17.156
And first of all,

00:04:17.156 --> 00:04:19.158
I think everybody is praying for Paul

00:04:19.158 --> 00:04:20.493
Pelosi speedy recovery

00:04:20.493 --> 00:04:21.461
at this point, as well

00:04:21.461 --> 00:04:23.796
as for the speaker and her family.

00:04:23.796 --> 00:04:26.332
But I think what Mr.

00:04:26.332 --> 00:04:28.468
McCarthy didn't say was that

00:04:28.468 --> 00:04:29.102
this is a form

00:04:29.102 --> 00:04:31.771
of political violence, Fredricka.

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:34.474
What the assailant shouted upon entry

00:04:34.474 --> 00:04:35.742
into the Pelosi household was,

00:04:35.742 --> 00:04:37.910
where's Nancy? Where's Nancy?

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:40.713
And that echoed exactly the chants

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.715
of the January six insurrectionists

00:04:42.715 --> 00:04:44.350
when they breached the Capitol

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:46.919
And this is just the culmination

00:04:46.919 --> 00:04:49.722
of the demonization of Nancy Pelosi

00:04:49.989 --> 00:04:51.491
by many folks

00:04:51.491 --> 00:04:52.959
on the other side of the aisle.

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:53.893
You know, my colleague

00:04:53.893 --> 00:04:55.928
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:04:55.928 --> 00:04:58.364
and Facebook post called for

00:04:59.465 --> 00:05:01.801
her being found to have committed treason

00:05:02.135 --> 00:05:03.169
and saying

00:05:03.169 --> 00:05:05.705
that execution was appropriate.

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:07.907
A GOP candidate for Senate

00:05:07.907 --> 00:05:09.542
in the Arizona primary

00:05:09.542 --> 00:05:10.176
last year

00:05:10.176 --> 00:05:11.110
ran a Super Bowl

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:12.545
ad featuring him

00:05:12.545 --> 00:05:15.381
shooting Nancy Pelosi in the ad.

00:05:15.882 --> 00:05:17.583
So this type of dangerous,

00:05:17.583 --> 00:05:19.252
violent rhetoric

00:05:19.252 --> 00:05:21.287
is going to lead to the natural result,

00:05:21.487 --> 00:05:22.522
which is violence.

00:05:22.522 --> 00:05:24.957
And that's what happened with populism.

00:05:24.957 --> 00:05:26.559
So is it your belief

00:05:26.559 --> 00:05:28.661
that if it were a Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:05:28.661 --> 00:05:30.697
or perhaps even Minority Leader

00:05:30.697 --> 00:05:33.333
McCarthy, if they were to say

00:05:35.301 --> 00:05:37.437
more forcefully

00:05:38.037 --> 00:05:39.472
singling out

00:05:39.472 --> 00:05:40.206
people

00:05:40.206 --> 00:05:41.441
who are coming from a

00:05:41.441 --> 00:05:43.209
particular persuasion

00:05:43.209 --> 00:05:45.578
ought not to be violent,

00:05:45.611 --> 00:05:47.647
not to help incite violence,

00:05:48.281 --> 00:05:50.216
to stop saying aloud

00:05:50.216 --> 00:05:51.217
the dangerous things

00:05:51.217 --> 00:05:53.853
that you just reiterate

00:05:53.853 --> 00:05:56.055
How much of a difference might that make

00:05:56.055 --> 00:05:56.723
in your view

00:05:57.957 --> 00:05:59.325
that make a big difference?

00:05:59.325 --> 00:06:00.893
Denouncing political violence

00:06:00.893 --> 00:06:02.061
of all stripes

00:06:02.061 --> 00:06:03.429
would make a big difference

00:06:03.429 --> 00:06:05.698
whether it's by elected officials

00:06:05.698 --> 00:06:08.067
or by former presidents like Donald Trump

00:06:08.401 --> 00:06:10.169
or by candidates for office.

00:06:10.169 --> 00:06:11.537
And let me just say one other thing.

00:06:11.537 --> 00:06:13.172
I think that we have to look at the role

00:06:13.172 --> 00:06:14.040
of social media

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:15.007
in amplifying

00:06:15.007 --> 00:06:17.076
this dangerous, violent rhetoric.

00:06:17.076 --> 00:06:18.611
You know, Facebook and Twitter

00:06:18.611 --> 00:06:20.012
and other platforms

00:06:20.012 --> 00:06:21.481
make a lot of money

00:06:21.481 --> 00:06:23.249
from this type of rhetoric.

00:06:23.249 --> 00:06:24.951
And the polarization

00:06:24.951 --> 00:06:26.285
that results from it.

00:06:26.285 --> 00:06:27.887
And we have to look very closely

00:06:27.887 --> 00:06:29.956
at repealing that liability

00:06:29.956 --> 00:06:31.391
that they enjoy

00:06:31.391 --> 00:06:34.961
from the negative consequences

00:06:34.961 --> 00:06:38.431
associated with with this type of content

00:06:38.798 --> 00:06:40.533
that is routinely trafficked on

00:06:40.533 --> 00:06:41.834
their platforms as well.

